WEBVTT

00:04.860 --> 00:05.700
Are you sure?

00:05.700 --> 00:07.360
You can't be serious.

00:09.970 --> 00:11.490
My, look at the time.

00:11.700 --> 00:13.110
I'm going to sleep now.

00:13.570 --> 00:15.240
I should go, too.

00:15.240 --> 00:16.280
I'm going to sleep, too.

00:16.460 --> 00:17.890
You hold down the fort.

00:17.890 --> 00:19.110
Okay, Senpai.

00:19.110 --> 00:20.680
Good night.

00:49.190 --> 00:53.210
Why do I always sleep here?

02:24.480 --> 02:25.740
But why?

02:25.740 --> 02:28.040
Why don't I have a room?

02:28.370 --> 02:30.700
Everyone else has a room!

02:28.910 --> 02:34.880
21: "Breakthrough"

02:30.700 --> 02:33.520
How is it right that I'm
the only one sleeping here?

02:33.520 --> 02:34.700
You don't have a room?

02:34.700 --> 02:35.800
No, I don't.

02:35.800 --> 02:38.050
That's why I'm complaining.

02:39.330 --> 02:41.550
That's hilarious! You don't have a room.

02:41.550 --> 02:42.700
You little...

02:42.700 --> 02:45.260
Sorry, I didn't notice, either.

02:45.260 --> 02:46.100
Me, neither.

02:46.320 --> 02:48.310
Even Hasshie has a room.

02:49.470 --> 02:52.670
I guess that's how unnoticeable you are.

02:52.670 --> 02:53.560
What?!

02:53.880 --> 02:56.940
It's true that it doesn't really
seem like you live here.

02:56.940 --> 02:58.940
You're more like a maid than a tenant.

02:58.940 --> 03:00.280
Senpai!

03:00.280 --> 03:01.590
Accept your fate.

03:01.590 --> 03:02.820
Senpai!

03:03.040 --> 03:04.160
'Sup.

03:04.550 --> 03:06.660
Why's everyone getting together
so early in the morning?

03:06.940 --> 03:10.520
We just realized Schu-san
doesn't have a room.

03:10.520 --> 03:13.040
I totally didn't notice, either.

03:13.380 --> 03:14.880
You, too, Landlady?

03:15.090 --> 03:16.170
No big deal.

03:16.170 --> 03:17.910
Just give him a room, right?

03:17.910 --> 03:21.630
This place is huge.
There must be a room or two.

03:27.120 --> 03:30.270
We're kind of using all
the rooms that we can.

03:30.600 --> 03:32.590
This is the only one left.

03:32.590 --> 03:33.580
Want to sleep standing?

03:33.580 --> 03:34.400
No way.

03:34.750 --> 03:36.110
I don't mind if it's small,

03:36.110 --> 03:40.110
I just want a clean spot where
I can lie down and relax.

03:40.740 --> 03:42.180
How about this?

03:43.260 --> 03:45.330
You get the garden view all to yourself.

03:45.330 --> 03:46.530
I'm jealous.

03:46.770 --> 03:49.240
No, it's way too cold in the winter.

03:49.240 --> 03:50.690
And there'll be bugs during the summer.

03:50.690 --> 03:53.590
I guess you won't get any
privacy in such plain sight.

03:53.590 --> 03:54.620
Exactly.

03:54.620 --> 03:57.900
I want to be by myself
every now and then, too.

03:57.900 --> 04:00.690
Oh, I know where you could go.

04:00.690 --> 04:01.800
Where?

04:02.770 --> 04:03.850
Well?

04:03.850 --> 04:06.800
Indeed, I can be by myself here.

04:08.130 --> 04:09.560
This is the washroom!

04:09.770 --> 04:12.090
Are you messing with me?

04:12.090 --> 04:13.720
It's so clean, though.

04:13.720 --> 04:16.980
That's because I always clean it.

04:16.980 --> 04:17.650
Why?

04:17.780 --> 04:18.590
Why?

04:18.590 --> 04:21.700
Why does a crazy person like you have a room,

04:21.700 --> 04:25.650
when a studious, upright person
like me doesn't get one?

04:25.650 --> 04:28.330
You got here later than everyone else.

04:28.330 --> 04:29.910
The rooms went out to the
people who got here first.

04:29.910 --> 04:32.030
I bet it's in order of talent.

04:32.800 --> 04:34.250
You...

04:34.250 --> 04:35.470
There, there.

04:35.470 --> 04:36.400
Landlady!

04:36.400 --> 04:37.570
Yes?

04:37.570 --> 04:42.530
I formally motion that one's right
to use the rooms be in proportion

04:42.530 --> 04:47.140
to their degree of contribution to Otowakan.

04:47.140 --> 04:48.890
Degree of contribution?

04:49.990 --> 04:52.580
So what do you contribute?

04:54.030 --> 04:55.520
Cleaning up after meals.

04:55.960 --> 04:56.940
Cleaning the washrooms.

04:57.300 --> 04:58.560
Weeding the yard.

04:58.890 --> 05:01.440
I'm doing all of it.

05:01.970 --> 05:02.900
Well?

05:03.280 --> 05:04.470
Kind of meh.

05:05.050 --> 05:07.720
You don't even pay the rent.
That's not saying much.

05:07.720 --> 05:08.910
C-Come on.

05:09.300 --> 05:11.490
B-But if we're going to
talk about unpaid rent...

05:12.600 --> 05:15.580
I've saved this mansion
from disaster many a time.

05:16.670 --> 05:17.710
Then...

05:17.710 --> 05:20.420
All that stuff I did for Kanae's birthday.

05:22.540 --> 05:25.940
I appreciated the sentiment, but I don't
know if that counts as contributing, Motes.

05:25.940 --> 05:29.210
Either way, compared to what
Beethes-san and Motes-san do,

05:29.210 --> 05:32.180
the stuff you do is pretty weak.

05:33.340 --> 05:35.150
I've got Musik, too.

05:36.710 --> 05:38.840
Your Musik, Schu-san?

05:39.210 --> 05:40.300
I can't really remember it.

05:40.300 --> 05:42.250
You can't remember?

05:42.250 --> 05:47.130
Oh, it really helps that you're
helping with the chores, though.

05:47.590 --> 05:48.700
In that case...

05:49.100 --> 05:51.020
A Musik Battle?

05:51.020 --> 05:51.870
That's right.

05:52.280 --> 05:56.290
Why don't we compete with our
Musik for rights to the rooms?

05:56.590 --> 05:58.580
Musik is not to be used for competition.

05:58.580 --> 06:01.370
I get that, but...

06:01.370 --> 06:03.300
I like it. It sounds fun.

06:03.580 --> 06:05.540
It could be fair, in a way.

06:05.540 --> 06:07.800
But I'm paying rent.

06:08.150 --> 06:13.070
Okay, with all due respect to
you, Senpai, we have a majority.

06:14.050 --> 06:16.060
Is there anything bothering you right now?

06:16.460 --> 06:20.700
Is there anything on your mind that
we could take care of with our Musik?

06:20.700 --> 06:23.160
What's bothering me right now?

06:23.160 --> 06:25.430
The fact that you guys aren't
paying rent, I guess?

06:25.430 --> 06:29.200
Can't we just call it even with my Musik?

06:30.310 --> 06:32.590
Something on my mind, huh?

06:34.800 --> 06:36.870
Restore this room?

06:36.870 --> 06:37.450
Yup.

06:37.850 --> 06:41.340
If we make this room usable,
that frees up another room.

06:41.340 --> 06:44.340
And you can live here if you
clean it up nicely, of course.

06:44.340 --> 06:46.370
You seriously ask for the
impossible, don't you?

06:46.370 --> 06:48.730
There's no way they could
do that, even with Musik.

06:48.730 --> 06:50.180
Move, boy!

06:50.900 --> 06:56.430
It's in a man's nature to want to do
things when they're told they can't.

06:59.310 --> 07:01.910
Here we go, Beethes-san's special move.

07:03.050 --> 07:04.810
It looks like Beethes-san's
taking it right off the bat.

07:04.810 --> 07:05.940
Not so fast!

07:07.240 --> 07:09.400
Don't underestimate me!

07:15.600 --> 07:16.980
Back off, Wolf.

07:16.980 --> 07:19.470
I'm going to be the one to clean up the room.

07:19.470 --> 07:21.330
Play nice, you two.

07:21.850 --> 07:24.880
You don't have enough love.

07:26.600 --> 07:28.460
It's a slugfest!

07:28.700 --> 07:30.430
Now's your chance.

07:30.430 --> 07:31.070
Huh?

07:32.140 --> 07:34.260
Shut up!

07:34.260 --> 07:36.300
I can't even!

07:36.300 --> 07:37.970
Come out!

07:39.880 --> 07:40.980
That was fun.

07:41.290 --> 07:44.480
And nothing's changed.

07:45.760 --> 07:47.980
It looks like my time has come.

07:48.830 --> 07:53.360
Behold, my raging tastefulness!

08:00.290 --> 08:04.080
Behold, my raging tastefulness!

08:05.790 --> 08:07.050
Rage!

08:07.050 --> 08:08.190
Explode!

08:08.190 --> 08:09.700
Charge!

08:10.860 --> 08:12.750
What happened to my tastefulness?

08:14.170 --> 08:16.570
Can you even use Musik?

08:16.570 --> 08:17.850
How dare you mock me?!

08:18.050 --> 08:22.270
Oh, yeah. Even back then,
it wasn't because I wanted it.

08:22.270 --> 08:24.630
It was because I was happy to see Senpai.

08:25.410 --> 08:27.600
That was true of the other Musik, too.

08:27.600 --> 08:32.240
In other words, my Musik is
uncontrollable, incontinent Musik?

08:32.690 --> 08:35.900
Don't tell me you can't make
it work when you want to.

08:35.900 --> 08:39.420
Or is it so weird that you
can't even show people?

08:40.230 --> 08:42.660
But what's the point of being a ClassicaLoid

08:42.660 --> 08:44.870
if you can't even use your Musik properly?

08:45.070 --> 08:46.450
Gah!

08:49.900 --> 08:50.550
Huh?

08:50.550 --> 08:51.540
Schu-kun?

08:52.350 --> 08:54.090
Schu-kun.

08:59.570 --> 09:02.560
Goodbye, my place of belonging.

09:02.920 --> 09:08.260
No, perhaps I was only being self-important
in supposing that it was.

09:08.260 --> 09:10.570
I have no reason to exist here.

09:11.110 --> 09:13.990
I shall set out on a journey to
discover my true way of being.

09:15.230 --> 09:17.990
Why do I exist?

09:22.110 --> 09:25.300
No one even takes note of me.

09:31.400 --> 09:34.380
Holy crap, it's so busy.

09:35.280 --> 09:36.990
This is insane.

09:36.990 --> 09:38.150
I...

09:38.150 --> 09:41.260
I'm right here.

09:46.200 --> 09:48.280
I'm right here.

09:50.820 --> 09:54.900
What is the value of my existence?

09:55.790 --> 09:57.760
No one even notices me.

10:06.780 --> 10:07.620
That's right.

10:07.620 --> 10:08.640
This place.

10:09.160 --> 10:12.630
This is the place where I was given new life.

10:12.630 --> 10:15.700
Here, I'll find my reason for being.

10:16.780 --> 10:21.250
Beethoven, Mozart, Liszt, Chopin...

10:21.250 --> 10:24.050
Nothing to report on the
ClassicaLoids at Otowakan.

10:24.460 --> 10:25.390
Huh?

10:25.390 --> 10:26.310
What is it?

10:26.830 --> 10:28.910
I feel like we're forgetting someone...

10:28.910 --> 10:30.310
You're just imagining things.

10:30.310 --> 10:32.080
You're right. I'm just imagining things.

10:32.080 --> 10:33.650
H-Hey...

10:34.050 --> 10:34.780
Wait.

10:34.780 --> 10:35.520
I...

10:35.520 --> 10:37.280
I, Schubert, am right here.

10:49.160 --> 10:52.020
What is the point of my existence?

11:26.340 --> 11:28.330
Where am I?

11:47.390 --> 11:48.220
Hey!

11:48.220 --> 11:50.420
You got no apologies for me?

11:50.420 --> 11:51.460
What now?

11:51.460 --> 11:54.350
You bump into me and just walk on?

11:56.330 --> 11:57.250
Mlergh!

11:58.030 --> 12:02.520
It hurts to be dismissed,
but it also hurts not to be.

12:16.380 --> 12:17.900
I need to eat.

12:22.460 --> 12:24.370
I'm done.

12:25.010 --> 12:28.600
I'm spent.

12:34.770 --> 12:36.680
And now I'm going to die?

12:37.150 --> 12:40.290
Without having even discovered what I am?

12:41.070 --> 12:42.610
This is it?

12:42.610 --> 12:45.640
Well, what a coincidence.

12:48.860 --> 12:50.040
Hello.

12:51.760 --> 12:52.520
Huh?

12:55.200 --> 12:57.460
Man, that's gotta suck.

12:57.820 --> 13:00.370
It's not funny!

13:00.900 --> 13:04.290
No one understands how I feel.

13:04.770 --> 13:05.820
I get it.

13:05.820 --> 13:07.550
It's a cold world out there, huh?

13:08.010 --> 13:12.260
You go and make us, and then you just vanish.

13:12.260 --> 13:13.920
The hell is that?

13:14.630 --> 13:16.440
Oh come on, don't say that.

13:16.440 --> 13:20.670
The Arkhe people would find
me if I was with you guys.

13:20.670 --> 13:24.030
Is that why you're wandering
around the world?

13:24.030 --> 13:25.110
Yup.

13:25.110 --> 13:28.830
This is one of my favorite hideouts.

13:28.830 --> 13:29.990
Look at them.

13:30.450 --> 13:33.100
Everyone's living free as they please.

13:33.490 --> 13:37.500
Everyone's doing whatever they
want, living to enjoy the moment.

13:38.450 --> 13:40.500
Whatever they want.

13:41.090 --> 13:42.600
Can I get another one?

13:42.600 --> 13:44.300
And an avocado.

13:52.110 --> 13:53.230
Why?

13:54.290 --> 13:57.980
Why did you create me?

14:00.650 --> 14:02.380
Answer me!

14:02.380 --> 14:04.590
Why did you create me?

14:04.590 --> 14:06.510
What am I?

14:07.630 --> 14:12.270
Remember? You never took me with you.

14:13.480 --> 14:17.340
Why didn't you take me when you
ran off with Senpai and Mozart?

14:19.070 --> 14:24.000
Am I unneeded even by you, my creator?

14:25.920 --> 14:27.210
It's nice, isn't it?

14:27.210 --> 14:28.630
Oden and avocado.

14:30.140 --> 14:33.970
This is the kind of self-indulgence
that makes life fun.

14:33.970 --> 14:36.390
What does your avocado have to do
with what we're talking about?

14:36.630 --> 14:38.630
The truth is,

14:38.630 --> 14:42.060
I was just indulging myself, and
you guys just kind of happened.

14:43.800 --> 14:46.400
So you ought to indulge yourself, too.

14:47.620 --> 14:51.910
That way, people will decide
for themselves what you are.

14:52.380 --> 14:53.670
B-But...

14:53.670 --> 14:57.970
All right, let's drink to
our heart's content, yeah?

15:02.770 --> 15:03.590
Yo.

15:04.010 --> 15:04.900
Yo!

15:12.630 --> 15:13.290
Huh?

15:18.180 --> 15:19.770
Pay the bill for me
-Kyougo

15:23.230 --> 15:24.400
Uh oh.

15:24.820 --> 15:27.290
I don't have any money right now.

15:33.230 --> 15:33.970
Money.

15:33.970 --> 15:34.920
Money!

15:45.460 --> 15:48.550
Come back, you bastard!

16:02.880 --> 16:04.100
Are you all right?

16:04.570 --> 16:06.530
This house is way too beat up, dude.

16:06.530 --> 16:08.280
That's why we're patching it.

16:09.000 --> 16:12.030
Why is there a typhoon?
It's not even typhoon season.

16:12.280 --> 16:13.320
How are you doing over there?

16:13.320 --> 16:17.520
Hey, I bet you could fly <i>really</i>
far if you got on the wind.

16:17.520 --> 16:20.540
How do you come up with wild
ideas in this situation?

16:20.540 --> 16:22.000
He's so nonchalant.

16:22.180 --> 16:24.020
This is a trial.

16:24.020 --> 16:26.960
Let us set forth into our destiny!

16:30.720 --> 16:31.680
What's wrong?

16:31.680 --> 16:34.010
Well, there's something way off in the storm.

16:35.230 --> 16:36.220
What is that?

16:36.220 --> 16:37.350
It's a bird!

16:37.350 --> 16:38.260
It's a plane!

16:38.260 --> 16:39.640
No, it's a kaiju!

16:43.470 --> 16:44.190
A kite?

16:45.440 --> 16:47.230
I'm going to crash!

16:50.440 --> 16:51.530
Schu-san?

16:52.650 --> 16:55.360
H-Help me!

16:59.480 --> 17:01.190
Thank you, Senpai.

17:01.190 --> 17:03.340
What are you doing?

17:03.580 --> 17:05.520
Seriously, we're super busy right now.

17:05.520 --> 17:07.560
How can you go off to have fun by yourself?

17:07.560 --> 17:08.450
No...

17:08.020 --> 17:08.880
Unbelievable.

17:09.250 --> 17:09.890
I...

17:09.890 --> 17:12.410
Yes, we don't have time to waste.

17:12.410 --> 17:14.070
Hurry up and help us.

17:14.820 --> 17:15.640
Okay.

17:26.810 --> 17:27.960
Impossible.

17:27.960 --> 17:32.030
Has no one noticed that I've
been gone these past few days?

17:33.590 --> 17:35.280
No one cares about me.

17:36.600 --> 17:38.700
No one knows how I feel.

17:40.140 --> 17:42.400
Everyone's so self-centered!

17:43.410 --> 17:44.470
...avocado.

17:45.460 --> 17:49.490
This is the kind of self-indulgence
that makes life fun.

17:49.490 --> 17:52.130
So you ought to indulge yourself, too.

17:59.610 --> 18:01.010
I'll do it.

18:01.010 --> 18:02.220
I shall...

18:02.220 --> 18:07.940
No! I <i>will</i> indulge myself!

18:09.650 --> 18:11.410
Wh-What?

18:11.410 --> 18:14.990
I-Is it his Musik?

18:15.420 --> 18:19.350
This is "Der Erlkönig,"
composed by Franz Schubert.

18:19.350 --> 18:23.790
Schubert was known for
putting music to poetry.

18:27.010 --> 18:30.460
I'm sick of y'all walking all over me.

18:30.460 --> 18:31.520
Not anymore.

18:31.520 --> 18:34.550
I'm nothing like the man I used to be.

18:34.670 --> 18:37.720
That's right, I've changed
since I met <i>that man</i>.

18:37.720 --> 18:39.670
I'm so done spending life
thinking of words to appease

18:39.670 --> 18:41.180
Endlessly sucking up, just to get teased

18:41.180 --> 18:42.670
Why should I care? Nobody's there

18:42.670 --> 18:44.180
Who do I please? Jeez, Louise

18:44.180 --> 18:44.950
¿Comprende?

18:44.950 --> 18:45.650
Andante

18:45.650 --> 18:46.970
Left to find answers and guess what I found?

18:46.970 --> 18:50.100
What were the chances
I'd find them in this town?

18:50.390 --> 18:51.940
Yeah, avocado

18:51.940 --> 18:53.440
My identity

18:53.440 --> 18:56.400
Isn't always something to seek, can't you see?

18:56.400 --> 18:57.860
That's right, avocado

18:57.860 --> 18:58.690
Be free

18:58.690 --> 18:59.860
Live and let be

18:59.860 --> 19:01.010
It's all about me

19:01.010 --> 19:03.750
That's the key, Jubilee

19:03.750 --> 19:06.840
You pathetic shits always have your way.

19:06.840 --> 19:10.050
Now it's my turn. I've got a
bone to pick with each of you.

19:10.050 --> 19:12.280
My man Chopin, you're up first.

19:12.280 --> 19:13.380
Check it out!

19:13.380 --> 19:15.290
Little boy's a tough guy online

19:15.290 --> 19:16.880
Never seen the sunshine

19:16.880 --> 19:18.670
Scared of everyone, crying

19:18.670 --> 19:21.290
What's the matter with you,
gloomy little vampire?

19:21.290 --> 19:22.780
You're a living Flatlander

19:22.780 --> 19:23.970
Just a sad little wanker

19:23.970 --> 19:25.340
"Love" that, "love" this

19:25.340 --> 19:27.300
It's all you've ever got, Liszt

19:27.300 --> 19:29.350
Time for an inquest

19:29.350 --> 19:31.970
That's it? Pay your rent,
and get away with murder?

19:31.970 --> 19:34.610
Can't show cleavage on this<i> channel, no sir</i>

19:34.610 --> 19:36.030
'Eyo Landlady

19:36.030 --> 19:36.690
No doubt

19:36.690 --> 19:37.970
This is getting old, but

19:37.970 --> 19:39.990
Hear me out, precious little girl scout

19:39.990 --> 19:42.810
Nagging every day, begging me to pay

19:42.810 --> 19:45.450
All right, fine, so do I get a place to stay?

19:45.710 --> 19:47.480
I'm sorry, do I even know you?

19:47.480 --> 19:51.000
You're nothing to me.
I've got nothing to say, man

19:51.000 --> 19:53.330
Such a fool you don't know
that you don't know jack

19:53.330 --> 19:54.120
Big mouth

19:54.120 --> 19:56.000
You're such a tool, you're
such a hack, drop out

19:56.220 --> 19:59.080
Here we go, world's most pestilent resident

19:59.080 --> 20:01.630
Walking sack of narcissistic selfishness

20:01.630 --> 20:04.160
I'm not ripping you off, dude.
Damn, you're jealous

20:04.160 --> 20:06.640
Have some reticence, son
Mamma's boy, Oedipus!

20:09.310 --> 20:12.040
I came this far in hopes
of winning your approval

20:12.040 --> 20:13.500
Seriously, mad respect, Senpai

20:13.500 --> 20:14.560
So I'll show you my battle cry

20:14.930 --> 20:17.240
I've got a chance to get over this wall

20:17.240 --> 20:19.940
Answer the call, winner-takes-all

20:20.210 --> 20:21.530
I've got sick timing

20:21.530 --> 20:22.860
Self-respect rising

20:22.860 --> 20:25.370
Listen up, kids, there's a great man rhyming

20:25.610 --> 20:28.110
All this time spent trying to wow a Casanova

20:28.110 --> 20:30.620
And don't get me started
on your half-baked gyoza

20:35.540 --> 20:36.880
I'm a Schubert

20:36.880 --> 20:37.990
You're not worth it

20:37.990 --> 20:39.500
I'm not butt hurt

20:39.500 --> 20:40.800
Just sick of your bullshit

20:40.800 --> 20:41.990
What you see is me

20:41.990 --> 20:43.310
Schubert to the nth degree

20:43.310 --> 20:46.100
That's all I'm going to guarantee, homey

20:46.100 --> 20:47.590
On my own terms

20:47.590 --> 20:48.990
Dishing out sick burns

20:48.990 --> 20:50.200
Self-indulgent

20:50.200 --> 20:52.020
Absolutely loving it

20:52.020 --> 20:55.190
Guess who taught me to be this way, yo

20:55.490 --> 20:57.710
Avocado, Arigato

20:57.710 --> 20:59.420
Arigato, Avocado

20:59.560 --> 21:01.200
Arigato, Avocado

21:01.200 --> 21:02.830
Arigato

21:02.830 --> 21:04.760
Avocado, Arigato

21:04.890 --> 21:06.700
Avocado, Arigato

21:06.700 --> 21:08.960
Arigato

21:27.270 --> 21:29.550
Morning, all.

21:29.980 --> 21:30.640
Huh?

21:31.050 --> 21:32.360
Where's Schu-san?

21:32.360 --> 21:33.700
He hasn't come home.

21:33.700 --> 21:35.570
What? Again?

21:35.570 --> 21:37.560
He's probably out all night again.

21:37.960 --> 21:40.550
He's completely changed since then.

21:40.550 --> 21:42.480
He's doing whatever the heck he wants now.

21:42.480 --> 21:47.040
And now there's so much stuff for
me to do: cleaning, laundry...

21:48.750 --> 21:49.890
He's home.

21:50.920 --> 21:52.540
Welcome home, Schu-san.

21:52.540 --> 21:57.670
Dude, I legit dig your new style.

21:57.670 --> 22:01.010
Can you teach me about rap and stuff?

22:01.010 --> 22:03.410
I gave up on you long ago.

22:03.410 --> 22:05.680
You ain't getting my help, no, no, no.

22:06.480 --> 22:08.690
Don't mess with him, you'll get burnt.

22:11.390 --> 22:12.350
Schu-san.

22:12.350 --> 22:14.360
Sorry to keep you waiting.

22:14.360 --> 22:17.060
It took us a while, but we finally
got a room cleaned up for you.

22:17.060 --> 22:18.790
I love my freedom.

22:18.790 --> 22:20.900
Not staying in one room.

22:20.900 --> 22:23.980
Gonna take a nappy nap as I please, yeah.

22:25.650 --> 22:28.680
So you don't want a room, is that right?

22:28.680 --> 22:30.550
Yeah.

22:38.490 --> 22:40.720
I got carried away.

22:40.720 --> 22:43.000
I'm truly sorry.

22:43.000 --> 22:46.010
To be continued

24:15.970 --> 24:26.110
A Discerning Man

24:16.560 --> 24:19.140
It beckons the mind of the genius,

24:19.140 --> 24:22.100
summoning creation and destruction,
ecstasy and darkness.

24:22.100 --> 24:24.860
Oh, enchanting cup of coffee.

24:24.860 --> 24:29.010
Seductive, deadly cup of coffee.
